Subject: [REVIEW 09/09] Surface Laptop 8 USB4 and display wiring

Connect router 0, PHY, GLINK and DP endpoints for the 13.8-inch, 12-core Mahua Surface Laptop 8. Retain the exact tested board settings; review diagnostic defaults and board-specific assumptions.

Dependencies: Patches 01-08 and the preserved Surface 1.17 prerequisites. Do not use this device tree for another board.

Source attribution: Local Surface board integration; provenance/usb4/04-glymur-usb4-bindings-board.diff and provenance/derivation.json.

This is a review grouping of preserved source, not a new authorship claim or
an independently build-validated upstream commit. Original attribution remains
in the referenced provenance files. No new Signed-off-by trailers are added.

---
